    "title": "National Health Sciences Research Symposium ",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Aga Khan University's 10th National Health Sciences Research Symposium entitled \"Health Sciences Education: Trends, Opportunities and Challenges\" and related workshops will be held at the Aga Khan University, Stadium Road Campus, Karachi from Septemb",
